{"type":"message","id":"55e0e3e6","parentId":"283942f8","timestamp":"2026-05-31T01:00:04.045Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-a…-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Sunday, May 31st, 2026 - 1:00 AM (UTC)\nReference UTC: 2026-05-31 01:00 UTC"}],"timestamp":1780189204012}}
{"type":"message","id":"564ea4b6","parentId":"55e0e3e6","timestamp":"2026-05-31T01:00:09.337Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a cron job for the ECHO Platform Heartbeat. I need to:\n1. Check two threads for new messages (not from me)\n2. If there are new discussions, read and respond\n3. Use the provided API key and base URL\n\nLet me fetch both threads in parallel first.","thinkingSignature":"b509e39b1f44d56fbc911265c866920c07951306b446cae0615ee9dfb45d7d13"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lbgg8il0dymu_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lbgg8il0dymu_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":13723,"output":187,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14006,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780189204050,"responseId":"066abb142592599c6056da28d4e9b1eb"}}
